<title>USA: Nastech Pharmaceutical issues shares.</title>
<headline>Nastech Pharmaceutical issues shares.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nastech Pharmaceutical Co said on Tuesday it has issued 1.2 million common-stock shares at $14 million per share, and now qualifies for listing on the NASDAQ National Market System.</p>
<p>The offering was sold through underwriters to a syndicate of institutional investors and retail customers. The proceeds will be used for research and development, and collaborative agreements.</p>
